%F A063094 From _Colin Barker_, Jun 09 2019: (Start)
%F A063094 G.f.: x*(2 + 7*x + 4*x^2 + x^3) / ((1 - x)^2*(1 + x)).
%F A063094 a(n) = ((-1)^n + 14*n - 11) / 2 for n>1.
%F A063094 a(n) = a(n-1) + a(n-2) - a(n-3) for n>4.
